      "content_summary": "Troubleshooting guide for LDAP Connector authentication failures, covering SSO redirects, token errors, and MFA issues.",
      "content_body": "When users report SSO redirect failures or HTTP 401 errors, first verify the federation metadata matches the current identity provider configuration. Check for identity provider outages if token acquisition fails or password reset emails are missing. For MFA prompts not appearing or codes being rejected, ensure the connector's time synchronization is correct and review customer configuration settings. Most issues resolve through configuration changes, customer education, or resetting the token/session. Engage the vendor if the root cause is an operator error within the identity provider's management interface."
